{"id": "4cc3a9db-8e5c-4c48-ac5b-a13f687f6bc8", "slug": "ai-platform-interface-1", "title": "AI Platform Interface", "description": "Platform Interface Feature Section is designed for highlighting product capabilities and value points. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-staff-featured-2026-05-22\"\nname: \"AI Platform Interface\"\ndescription: \"Platform Interface Feature Section is designed for highlighting product capabilities and value points. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#06B6D4\"\n  secondary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  accent: \"#06B6D4\"\n  background: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  surface: \"#1A1F2B\"\n  text-primary: \"#111827\"\n  text-secondary: \"#4B5563\"\n  border: \"#252A38\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"16px\"\n  control: \"8px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# AI Platform Interface\nSource: Neuform staff featured templates. Author: Aksonvady Phomhome (@aksonvady). Views: 274; favorites: 15; remixes: 4.\nTags: feature, section, animated, bento.\n## Overview\nPlatform Interface Feature Section is designed for highlighting product capabilities and value points. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\n\nHi james 👋 how can i help you today? AI sidebar Just one-click to access all AI features from any web page. Available on all platforms Chat with your favorite assistant from browser, desktop and mobile phone. Large lan…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: AI sidebar; Available on all platforms; Smart toolbar; Writing assistant; Web enhancement.\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #06B6D4, secondary #FFFFFF, accent #06B6D4, background #FFFFFF, surface #1A1F2B, text-primary #111827. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Inter for display moments and Inter for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nCards, buttons, badges, navigation, and repeated blocks should preserve the source geometry, border treatment, and hover feel.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\" class=\"antialiased text-slate-50 selection:bg-cyan-500/30\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>AI Platform Interface</title>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/three.js/r128/three.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/ScrollTrigger.min.js\"></script>\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n</head>\n<body class=\"relative min-h-screen w-full bg-gradient-to-br from-[#e0f5f5] via-[#f1f8f8] to-[#e0f5f5] flex items-center justify-center py-20 px-4 sm:px-8 font-['Inter',sans-serif] m-0 overflow-x-hidden [scrollbar-width:none] [-ms-overflow-style:none] [&::-webkit-scrollbar]:hidden\" style=\"background-image: repeating-linear-gradient(45deg, transparent, transparent 10px, rgba(0,0,0,0.02) 10px, rgba(0,0,0,0.02) 11px); background-color: #f0f4f8;\">\n\n    <!-- WebGL Canvas Background -->\n    <canvas id=\"webgl-canvas\" class=\"fixed inset-0 w-full h-full pointer-events-none z-0\" style=\"display: block;\"></canvas>\n\n    <!-- Main Framed Container -->\n    <main class=\"relative z-10 w-full max-w-6xl mx-auto\">\n\n        <!-- Framed Layout Corner Brackets -->\n        <div class=\"absolute -top-4 -left-4 w-6 h-6 border-t border-l border-slate-400/30 z-20\"></div>\n        <div class=\"absolute -top-4 -right-4 w-6 h-6 border-t border-r border-slate-400/30 z-20\"></div>\n        <div class=\"absolute -bottom-4 -left-4 w-6 h-6 border-b border-l border-slate-400/30 z-20\"></div>\n        <div class=\"absolute -bottom-4 -right-4 w-6 h-6 border-b border-r border-slate-400/30 z-20\"></div>\n\n        <!-- Bento Grid -->\n        <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-6 gap-4 sm:gap-6 w-full gs-grid-container relative\">\n\n            <!-- Grid Lines (Framed Layout Directive) -->\n            <div class=\"absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none border border-slate-400/10 z-0\"></div>\n\n            <!-- Card 1: AI Sidebar (Span 2) -->\n            <div class=\"md:col-span-2 relative p-[1px] rounded-[2rem] overflow-hidden group gs-card\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.15) 0%, rgba(255,255,255,0) 100%);\">\n                <div class=\"bg-[#11141D] w-full h-full rounded-[calc(2rem-1px)] p-8 flex flex-col relative overflow-hidden\">\n\n                    <!-- Glows -->\n                    <div class=\"absolute bottom-1/4 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-48 h-48 bg-cyan-500/40 rounded-full blur-[60px] pointer-events-none gs-glow\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"absolute bottom-1/4 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-24 h-24 bg-white/20 rounded-full blur-[30px] pointer-events-none mix-blend-overlay\"></div>\n\n                    <!-- Visual Area -->\n                    <div class=\"flex-grow flex flex-col items-center justify-start pt-4 relative z-10\">\n                        <!-- Main floating box -->\n                        <div class=\"w-full max-w-[240px] bg-[#1A1F2B]/80 backdrop-blur-md rounded-2xl p-4 border border-white/5 shadow-2xl relative mb-12\">\n                            <p class=\"text-xs text-slate-300 mb-4 flex items-center gap-1\">Hi james <span class=\"text-sm\">👋</span> how can i help you today?</p>\n\n                            <div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-2\">\n                                <!-- Mock Input 1 -->\n                                <div class=\"bg-white/5 rounded-xl p-2.5 flex items-center gap-2 border border-white/5\">\n                                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:magnifer-linear\" class=\"text-slate-400 text-base\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                                    <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-1 w-full\">\n                                        <div class=\"h-1 bg-white/20 rounded-full w-3/4\"></div>\n                                        <div class=\"h-1 bg-white/10 rounded-full w-1/2\"></div>\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n                                <!-- Mock Input 2 -->\n                                <div class=\"bg-white/5 rounded-xl p-2.5 flex items-center gap-2 border border-white/5\">\n                                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:document-text-linear\" class=\"text-slate-400 text-base\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                                    <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-1 w-full\">\n                                        <div class=\"h-1 bg-white/20 rounded-full w-full\"></div>\n                                        <div class=\"h-1 bg-white/10 rounded-full w-2/3\"></div>\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n                                <!-- Mock Input 3 -->\n                                <div class=\"bg-white/5 rounded-xl p-2.5 flex items-center gap-2 border border-white/5\">\n                                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:pen-new-square-linear\" class=\"text-slate-400 text-base\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                                    <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-1 w-full\">\n                                        <div class=\"h-1 bg-white/20 rounded-full w-2/3\"></div>\n                                        <div class=\"h-1 bg-white/10 rounded-full w-1/3\"></div>\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n                                <!-- Mock Input 4 -->\n                                <div class=\"bg-white/5 rounded-xl p-2.5 flex items-center gap-2 border border-white/5\">\n                                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:pen-2-linear\" class=\"text-slate-400 text-base\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                                    <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-1 w-full\">\n                                        <div class=\"h-1 bg-white/20 rounded-full w-full\"></div>\n                                        <div class=\"h-1 bg-white/10 rounded-full w-1/2\"></div>\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n\n                            <!-- Connection Line down -->\n                            <div class=\"absolute -bottom-8 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-[1px] h-8 bg-gradient-to-b from-white/20 to-cyan-400/50\"></div>\n                            <div class=\"absolute -bottom-[2px] left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-white/50\"></div>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <!-- Central Node -->\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 relative mt-2\">\n                            <div class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-full border border-white/10 bg-white/5\"></div>\n                            <div class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-cyan-500/20 border border-cyan-500/30 flex items-center justify-center relative shadow-[0_0_20px_rgba(6,182,212,0.4)] gs-pulse\">\n                                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:stars-minimalistic-linear\" class=\"text-white text-lg\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                                <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-white/20 rounded-full blur-[4px]\"></div>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-full border border-white/10 bg-white/5\"></div>\n                            <div class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-full border border-white/10 bg-white/5 opacity-50\"></div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Text Area -->\n                    <div class=\"mt-auto relative z-10 pt-8\">\n                        <h3 class=\"text-lg font-medium text-white tracking-tight mb-2\">AI sidebar</h3>\n                        <p class=\"text-sm text-slate-400 leading-relaxed\">Just one-click to access all AI features from any web page.</p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Card 2: Platforms (Span 4) -->\n            <div class=\"md:col-span-4 relative p-[1px] rounded-[2rem] overflow-hidden group gs-card\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.15) 0%, rgba(255,255,255,0) 100%);\">\n                <div class=\"bg-[#11141D] w-full h-full rounded-[calc(2rem-1px)] p-8 flex flex-col relative overflow-hidden\">\n\n                    <!-- Glows -->\n                    <div class=\"absolute top-1/2 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-[400px] h-[300px] bg-cyan-500/20 rounded-full blur-[80px] pointer-events-none\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"absolute top-1/2 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-[200px] h-[200px] bg-teal-500/20 rounded-full blur-[60px] pointer-events-none mix-blend-screen -ml-10\"></div>\n                    <!-- Diagonal Light Beam -->\n                    <div class=\"absolute top-0 left-[40%] w-[150px] h-[300px] bg-white/10 blur-[40px] transform -rotate-45 pointer-events-none origin-bottom\"></div>\n\n                    <!-- Visual Area -->\n                    <div class=\"flex-grow flex items-center justify-center relative z-10 min-h-[280px]\">\n\n                        <!-- Connection Lines SVG -->\n                        <svg class=\"absolute inset-0 w-full h-full pointer-events-none\" style=\"filter: drop-shadow(0 0 4px rgba(255,255,255,0.1));\">\n                            <path d=\"M200,150 L350,150\" stroke=\"rgba(255,255,255,0.1)\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" fill=\"none\" vector-effect=\"non-scaling-stroke\" />\n                            <path d=\"M600,150 L450,150\" stroke=\"rgba(255,255,255,0.1)\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" fill=\"none\" vector-effect=\"non-scaling-stroke\" />\n                            <path d=\"M400,100 L400,50 L250,50\" stroke=\"rgba(255,255,255,0.1)\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" fill=\"none\" vector-effect=\"non-scaling-stroke\" />\n                            <path d=\"M400,200 L400,250 L650,250\" stroke=\"rgba(255,255,255,0.1)\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" fill=\"none\" vector-effect=\"non-scaling-stroke\" />\n                            <path d=\"M300,200 L300,220\" stroke=\"rgba(255,255,255,0.1)\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" fill=\"none\" vector-effect=\"non-scaling-stroke\" />\n                            <path d=\"M550,100 L550,80\" stroke=\"rgba(255,255,255,0.1)\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" fill=\"none\" vector-effect=\"non-scaling-stroke\" />\n                        </svg>\n\n                        <!-- Central Star Node -->\n                        <div class=\"w-24 h-24 rounded-full bg-[#1A1F2B] border-4 border-[#252A38] flex items-center justify-center relative z-20 shadow-2xl\">\n                            <div class=\"absolute inset-0 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-tr from-cyan-500/20 to-teal-500/20 opacity-50 blur-[2px]\"></div>\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:stars-minimalistic-linear\" class=\"text-white text-3xl drop-shadow-[0_0_10px_rgba(255,255,255,0.8)]\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <!-- Platform Nodes -->\n                        <!-- Chrome -->\n                        <div class=\"absolute left-[15%] top-[45%] w-14 h-14 rounded-full bg-white/5 border border-white/10 flex items-center justify-center backdrop-blur-sm z-10\">\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:browser-linear\" class=\"text-slate-300 text-xl\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                        </div>\n                        <!-- Apple -->\n                        <div class=\"absolute left-[25%] top-[15%] w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-white/5 border border-white/10 flex items-center justify-center backdrop-blur-sm z-10\">\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:apple-linear\" class=\"text-slate-300 text-xl\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                        </div>\n                        <!-- Gear/Setting -->\n                        <div class=\"absolute left-[35%] bottom-[20%] w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-white/5 border border-white/10 flex items-center justify-center backdrop-blur-sm z-10 opacity-70\">\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:settings-linear\" class=\"text-slate-300 text-base\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                        </div>\n                        <!-- Windows -->\n                        <div class=\"absolute right-[15%] top-[30%] w-16 h-16 rounded-full bg-white/5 border border-white/10 flex items-center justify-center backdrop-blur-sm z-10 bg-gradient-to-br from-white/10 to-transparent\">\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:windows-linear\" class=\"text-slate-300 text-2xl\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                        </div>\n                        <!-- Android -->\n                        <div class=\"absolute right-[25%] bottom-[15%] w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-white/5 border border-white/10 flex items-center justify-center backdrop-blur-sm z-10\">\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:smartphone-linear\" class=\"text-slate-300 text-base\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                        </div>\n                        <!-- Refresh/Sync -->\n                        <div class=\"absolute right-[35%] top-[10%] w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-white/5 border border-white/10 flex items-center justify-center backdrop-blur-sm z-10 opacity-70\">\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:refresh-circle-linear\" class=\"text-slate-300 text-base\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Text Area -->\n                    <div class=\"mt-auto relative z-10 pt-8 max-w-md\">\n                        <h3 class=\"text-lg font-medium text-white tracking-tight mb-2\">Available on all platforms</h3>\n                        <p class=\"text-sm text-slate-400 leading-relaxed\">Chat with your favorite assistant from browser, desktop and mobile phone.</p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Card 3: Smart Toolbar (Span 2) -->\n            <div class=\"md:col-span-2 relative p-[1px] rounded-[2rem] overflow-hidden group gs-card\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.15) 0%, rgba(255,255,255,0) 100%);\">\n                <div class=\"bg-[#11141D] w-full h-full rounded-[calc(2rem-1px)] p-8 flex flex-col relative overflow-hidden\">\n\n                    <!-- Glows -->\n                    <div class=\"absolute bottom-1/3 left-1/4 w-32 h-32 bg-teal-500/30 rounded-full blur-[50px] pointer-events-none\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"absolute bottom-1/3 right-1/4 w-32 h-32 bg-cyan-500/30 rounded-full blur-[50px] pointer-events-none\"></div>\n\n                    <!-- Visual Area -->\n                    <div class=\"flex-grow flex flex-col items-center justify-center relative z-10 py-6\">\n\n                        <!-- Text Box -->\n                        <div class=\"bg-[#1A1F2B]/80 backdrop-blur-md rounded-2xl p-4 border border-white/5 shadow-xl w-full mb-6 relative\">\n                            <p class=\"text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed\">Large language models are advanced ai system that <span class=\"bg-white text-slate-900 px-1 rounded font-medium relative inline-block\"><span class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-cyan-400 opacity-20 blur-sm rounded\"></span>understand</span> and generate human-like text.</p>\n                            <!-- Arrow down -->\n                            <div class=\"absolute -bottom-2 left-10 w-4 h-4 bg-[#1A1F2B]/80 border-b border-r border-white/5 transform rotate-45 backdrop-blur-md\"></div>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <!-- Toolbar -->\n                        <div class=\"bg-[#161A24] rounded-full px-4 py-2 border border-white/10 shadow-2xl flex items-center gap-4 relative z-20\">\n                            <button class=\"text-slate-400 hover:text-white transition-colors\"><iconify-icon icon=\"solar:bookmark-linear\" text-base stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon></button>\n                            <button class=\"text-slate-400 hover:text-white transition-colors\"><iconify-icon icon=\"solar:translate-linear\" text-base stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon></button>\n                            <button class=\"text-slate-400 hover:text-white transition-colors\"><iconify-icon icon=\"solar:maximize-square-linear\" text-base stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon></button>\n                            <button class=\"text-slate-400 hover:text-white transition-colors\"><iconify-icon icon=\"solar:text-align-left-linear\" text-base stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon></button>\n                            <div class=\"w-[1px] h-4 bg-white/10\"></div>\n                            <button class=\"text-slate-400 hover:text-white transition-colors\"><iconify-icon icon=\"solar:menu-dots-bold\" text-base></iconify-icon></button>\n                            <button class=\"w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-white/10 flex items-center justify-center ml-2 border border-white/20\">\n                                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:stars-minimalistic-linear\" class=\"text-white text-xs\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                            </button>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Text Area -->\n                    <div class=\"mt-auto relative z-10 pt-4\">\n                        <h3 class=\"text-lg font-medium text-white tracking-tight mb-2\">Smart toolbar</h3>\n                        <p class=\"text-sm text-slate-400 leading-relaxed\">Seamlessly explain, translate or summarize any text you select.</p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Card 4: Writing Assistant (Span 2) -->\n            <div class=\"md:col-span-2 relative p-[1px] rounded-[2rem] overflow-hidden group gs-card\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.15) 0%, rgba(255,255,255,0) 100%);\">\n                <div class=\"bg-[#11141D] w-full h-full rounded-[calc(2rem-1px)] p-8 flex flex-col relative overflow-hidden\">\n\n                    <!-- Sweeping Light Glow -->\n                    <div class=\"absolute top-0 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-full h-[60%] pointer-events-none z-0 overflow-hidden\">\n                        <!-- Curved shape simulating light beam -->\n                        <div class=\"absolute -top-[10%] left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-[150%] h-full bg-gradient-to-b from-cyan-400/80 via-cyan-500/20 to-transparent rounded-[100%] blur-[20px] mix-blend-screen gs-beam\"></div>\n                        <div class=\"absolute top-0 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-[80%] h-full bg-gradient-to-b from-white/60 via-transparent to-transparent rounded-[100%] blur-[10px] mix-blend-overlay\"></div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Visual Area -->\n                    <div class=\"flex-grow flex items-end justify-center relative z-10 pb-6\">\n\n                        <!-- Chat Input Box -->\n                        <div class=\"bg-[#1A1F2B]/90 backdrop-blur-xl rounded-xl border border-white/10 shadow-2xl w-full overflow-hidden\">\n                            <div class=\"p-4 border-b border-white/5\">\n                                <div class=\"bg-white/5 rounded px-3 py-1.5 inline-block text-[10px] text-slate-300 border border-white/5\">We've recived your email and will reply soon.</div>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"p-4\">\n                                <p class=\"text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed mb-6\">Thanks you for reaching out to us. we have recived your eamil and will ensure a prompt response.</p>\n\n                                <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mt-2\">\n                                    <button class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-white/5 border border-white/10 text-[10px] text-slate-300 hover:bg-white/10 transition-colors\">\n                                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:stars-minimalistic-linear\" class=\"text-cyan-400\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon> Ask follow up\n                                    </button>\n                                    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 text-slate-500\">\n                                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:copy-linear\" class=\"hover:text-slate-300 cursor-pointer\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:refresh-linear\" class=\"hover:text-slate-300 cursor-pointer\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:add-circle-linear\" class=\"hover:text-slate-300 cursor-pointer\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Text Area -->\n                    <div class=\"mt-auto relative z-10 pt-4\">\n                        <h3 class=\"text-lg font-medium text-white tracking-tight mb-2\">Writing assistant</h3>\n                        <p class=\"text-sm text-slate-400 leading-relaxed\">Help you draft or rewrite any content in any web page.</p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Card 5: Web Enhancement (Span 2) -->\n            <div class=\"md:col-span-2 relative p-[1px] rounded-[2rem] overflow-hidden group gs-card\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.15) 0%, rgba(255,255,255,0) 100%);\">\n                <div class=\"bg-[#11141D] w-full h-full rounded-[calc(2rem-1px)] p-8 flex flex-col relative overflow-hidden\">\n\n                    <!-- Glows -->\n                    <div class=\"absolute top-1/2 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-48 h-48 bg-teal-500/20 rounded-full blur-[60px] pointer-events-none\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"absolute bottom-1/4 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-32 h-32 bg-cyan-500/20 rounded-full blur-[40px] pointer-events-none\"></div>\n\n                    <!-- Visual Area -->\n                    <div class=\"flex-grow flex flex-col items-center justify-start pt-6 relative z-10\">\n\n                        <!-- Top Icons -->\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 bg-[#1A1F2B]/50 rounded-full px-4 py-2 border border-white/5 backdrop-blur-sm relative z-20\">\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:global-linear\" class=\"text-slate-400 text-lg\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                            <div class=\"w-6 h-6 rounded bg-cyan-500/20 flex items-center justify-center relative shadow-[0_0_10px_rgba(6,182,212,0.3)]\">\n                                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:play-circle-linear\" class=\"text-cyan-400 text-sm\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                            </div>\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:letter-linear\" class=\"text-slate-400 text-lg\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <!-- Connection Line down -->\n                        <div class=\"w-[1px] h-6 bg-gradient-to-b from-white/20 to-transparent relative z-10\">\n                            <div class=\"absolute top-1/2 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-white/50 border border-white\"></div>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <!-- Scanning Block -->\n                        <div class=\"bg-[#1A1F2B]/90 rounded-2xl p-4 border border-white/10 w-3/4 max-w-[180px] relative overflow-hidden shadow-2xl mt-1 h-24 flex flex-col gap-3\">\n                            <div class=\"flex items-start gap-3\">\n                                <div class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded bg-white/10 flex-shrink-0\"></div>\n                                <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-1.5 w-full mt-1\">\n                                    <div class=\"h-1.5 bg-white/20 rounded-full w-full\"></div>\n                                    <div class=\"h-1.5 bg-white/10 rounded-full w-2/3\"></div>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"h-1.5 bg-white/10 rounded-full w-full mt-auto\"></div>\n\n                            <!-- Animated Scanning Line -->\n                            <div class=\"absolute top-0 left-0 w-full h-full pointer-events-none z-30 gs-scan-container\">\n                                <div class=\"absolute top-0 left-0 w-full h-[2px] bg-cyan-400 shadow-[0_0_15px_rgba(6,182,212,0.8),0_0_5px_rgba(255,255,255,1)] gs-scan-line\"></div>\n                                <div class=\"absolute top-0 left-0 w-full h-8 bg-gradient-to-b from-cyan-500/20 to-transparent gs-scan-trail\"></div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Text Area -->\n                    <div class=\"mt-auto relative z-10 pt-8\">\n                        <h3 class=\"text-lg font-medium text-white tracking-tight mb-2\">Web enhancement</h3>\n                        <p class=\"text-sm text-slate-400 leading-relaxed\">Seamlessly explain, translate or summarize any text you select.</p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n        </div>\n    </main>\n\n    <!-- WebGL & Animation Scripts -->\n    <script>\n        document.addEventListener(\"DOMContentLoaded\", () => {\n\n            // --- WebGL Dot Matrix Background ---\n            const initWebGL = () => {\n                const canvas = document.getElementById('webgl-canvas');\n                if (!canvas) return;\n\n                const scene = new THREE.Scene();\n\n                const camera = new THREE.PerspectiveCamera(75, window.innerWidth / window.innerHeight, 0.1, 1000);\n                camera.position.z = 50;\n\n                const renderer = new THREE.WebGLRenderer({ canvas, alpha: true, antialias: true });\n                renderer.setPixelRatio(Math.min(window.devicePixelRatio, 2)); // DPR clamp\n                renderer.setSize(window.innerWidth, window.innerHeight);\n\n                // Custom Shader Material for Dots with soft depth fade\n                const customShaderMaterial = new THREE.ShaderMaterial({\n                    uniforms: {\n                        uTime: { value: 0 },\n                        uMouse: { value: new THREE.Vector2(0, 0) },\n                        uColor: { value: new THREE.Color('#000000') } // Black color for dots as per requirement\n                    },\n                    vertexShader: `\n                        uniform float uTime;\n                        uniform vec2 uMouse;\n                        varying float vZ;\n\n                        void main() {\n                            vec3 pos = position;\n\n                            // Pointer parallax / drift effect\n                            pos.x += uMouse.x * 2.0 * (pos.z / 50.0);\n                            pos.y -= uMouse.y * 2.0 * (pos.z / 50.0);\n\n                            // Slow breathing pulse on Z\n                            pos.z += sin(pos.x * 0.1 + uTime * 0.5) * 2.0;\n\n                            vec4 mvPosition = modelViewMatrix * vec4(pos, 1.0);\n                            gl_PointSize = (15.0 / -mvPosition.z); // Size attenuation\n                            gl_Position = projectionMatrix * mvPosition;\n\n                            vZ = pos.z;\n                        }\n                    `,\n                    fragmentShader: `\n                        uniform vec3 uColor;\n                        varying float vZ;\n\n                        void main() {\n                            // Create soft dot shape\n                            vec2 xy = gl_PointCoord.xy - vec2(0.5);\n                            float ll = length(xy);\n                            if(ll > 0.5) discard;\n\n                            // Soft edge\n                            float alpha = smoothstep(0.5, 0.3, ll);\n\n                            // Depth fade (fade out particles further away or closer)\n                            // Scene Z range roughly -50 to 50\n                            float depthAlpha = smoothstep(50.0, 10.0, abs(vZ));\n\n                            // Overall sparse opacity\n                            alpha *= depthAlpha * 0.4;\n\n                            gl_FragColor = vec4(uColor, alpha);\n                        }\n                    `,\n                    transparent: true,\n                    depthWrite: false,\n                    blending: THREE.NormalBlending\n                });\n\n                // Create Particle Matrix\n                const geometry = new THREE.BufferGeometry();\n                const particlesCount = 2000; // Sparse spacing\n                const posArray = new Float32Array(particlesCount * 3);\n\n                const spread = 150;\n                for(let i = 0; i < particlesCount * 3; i+=3) {\n                    posArray[i] = (Math.random() - 0.5) * spread * 2; // x\n                    posArray[i+1] = (Math.random() - 0.5) * spread; // y\n                    posArray[i+2] = (Math.random() - 0.5) * 100; // z\n                }\n\n                geometry.setAttribute('position', new THREE.BufferAttribute(posArray, 3));\n                const particlesMesh = new THREE.Points(geometry, customShaderMaterial);\n                scene.add(particlesMesh);\n\n                // Mouse interaction\n                let mouseX = 0;\n                let mouseY = 0;\n                let targetX = 0;\n                let targetY = 0;\n                const windowHalfX = window.innerWidth / 2;\n                const windowHalfY = window.innerHeight / 2;\n\n                document.addEventListener('mousemove', (event) => {\n                    mouseX = (event.clientX - windowHalfX) * 0.001;\n                    mouseY = (event.clientY - windowHalfY) * 0.001;\n                });\n\n                // Animation Loop\n                const clock = new THREE.Clock();\n\n                const animate = () => {\n                    const elapsedTime = clock.getElapsedTime();\n\n                    // Smooth mouse target interpolation\n                    targetX = targetX + (mouseX - targetX) * 0.05;\n                    targetY = targetY + (mouseY - targetY) * 0.05;\n\n                    customShaderMaterial.uniforms.uTime.value = elapsedTime;\n                    customShaderMaterial.uniforms.uMouse.value.set(targetX, targetY);\n\n                    // Slight overall scene rotation for atmospheric drift\n                    particlesMesh.rotation.y = elapsedTime * 0.02;\n                    particlesMesh.rotation.x = elapsedTime * 0.01;\n\n                    renderer.render(scene, camera);\n                    requestAnimationFrame(animate);\n                };\n\n                animate();\n\n                // Handle Resize\n                window.addEventListener('resize', () => {\n                    camera.aspect = window.innerWidth / window.innerHeight;\n                    camera.updateProjectionMatrix();\n                    renderer.setSize(window.innerWidth, window.innerHeight);\n                });\n            };\n\n            initWebGL();\n\n            // --- GSAP Animations ---\n            gsap.registerPlugin(ScrollTrigger);\n\n            // Initial Stagger Reveal\n            gsap.fromTo('.gs-card',\n                { y: 60, opacity: 0 },\n                {\n                    y: 0,\n                    opacity: 1,\n                    duration: 0.8,\n                    stagger: 0.1,\n                    ease: 'power3.out',\n                    scrollTrigger: {\n                        trigger: '.gs-grid-container',\n                        start: 'top 80%',\n                    }\n                }\n            );\n\n            // Card 1: Pulse effect on central node\n            gsap.to('.gs-pulse', {\n                scale: 1.05,\n                opacity: 0.8,\n                duration: 2,\n                repeat: -1,\n                yoyo: true,\n                ease: 'sine.inOut'\n            });\n\n            // Card 4: Light beam subtle wave\n            gsap.to('.gs-beam', {\n                opacity: 0.6,\n                scaleX: 1.05,\n                duration: 3,\n                repeat: -1,\n                yoyo: true,\n                ease: 'sine.inOut'\n            });\n\n            // Card 5: Scanning line animation\n            const scanTl = gsap.timeline({ repeat: -1 });\n            scanTl.fromTo('.gs-scan-line',\n                { top: 0 },\n                { top: '100%', duration: 2, ease: 'linear' }\n            );\n            scanTl.fromTo('.gs-scan-trail',\n                { top: '-2rem' },\n                { top: '100%', duration: 2, ease: 'linear' },\n                \"<\" // Sync with previous animation\n            );\n            // Quick fade out at bottom, instantly back to top, quick fade in\n            scanTl.to(['.gs-scan-line', '.gs-scan-trail'], { opacity: 0, duration: 0.2 });\n            scanTl.set(['.gs-scan-line', '.gs-scan-trail'], { top: 0 });\n            scanTl.to(['.gs-scan-line', '.gs-scan-trail'], { opacity: 1, duration: 0.2 });\n\n        });\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "ai-platform-interface-1.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/staff-featured-2026-05-22/ai-platform-interface-1.jpg", "source_name": "ai-platform-interface-1-DESIGN.md", "views": 422, "forks": 8, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "2e815afb-cac1-4c01-90e1-cf3810246e35", "created_at": "2026-05-22T07:58:12.433844+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-03T11:10:01.795946+00:00"}